<!-- ===== Intro ===== -->
<section class="px-block" style="padding-bottom:56px">
  <div class="ht-wrap">
    <div class="px-sec-head px-reveal" style="margin-bottom:0;max-width:860px">
      <div class="px-kicker">Frying · Evaporation · Recovery</div>
      <h2>Custom thermal and process equipment for food production.</h2>
      <p>Food plants run continuously, and the thermal equipment in them works to tight temperature windows — hot enough to do the job, never hot enough to damage the product or the oil.</p>
      <p>Harris Thermal builds the fry oil heaters, exchangers, evaporators, crystallizers and ASME vessels that carry those duties, designed to your process conditions and built for long service under continuous production.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

