<!-- ===== Fry oil ===== -->
<section class="px-block" id="fry-oil">
  <div class="ht-wrap px-split">
    <div class="px-reveal">
      <div class="px-kicker">A Leader in Industrial Fry Oil Heaters</div>
      <h2>Fry oil heating, designed rather than selected.</h2>
      <p>Harris Thermal has extensive experience designing and fabricating custom fry oil heat exchangers for large-scale potato and fried-food processing applications.</p>
      <p>Oil degrades with time at temperature, so the useful design target is not just the duty — it is delivering that duty without local overheating at the tube wall, in a unit that stays cleanable and serviceable in a plant that never stops. See our <a href="/shell-and-tube-heat-exchangers/">shell and tube heat exchanger fabrication</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="px-photo px-reveal">
      <img src="/sites/harristhermal2/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/109_0376-1024x768.jpg" alt="Food processing heat transfer equipment under fabrication in the Harris Thermal shop" loading="lazy">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

